                    </div>
                    <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; margin-top: 20px;">
                        <h3 style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;">Department of Defense</h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 12px;">Approximately $500,000 awarded for pattern recognition and image processing.</p>
                        <p style="font-size: 12px;">Dr. Nan Zhang</p>
                    </div>
                    <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; margin-top: 20px;">
                        <h3 style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;">Verizon</h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 12px;">Innovative learning program for minority males.</p>
                        <p style="font-size: 12px;">Dr. James Malen ($89,000)</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
