    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
        <div style="width: 30%;">
            <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;">Developing the Pathway</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 14px;">We support our students on their academic journeys by providing seamless pathways to the middle class. Increased local support has provided much-needed resources to address our human resources, and we have deployed a new performance management system, and implemented a data-driven management process to effectively gauge our performance.</p>
                <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                    <p style="font-size: 14px;">"After leaving the military, UDC gave me the opportunity to finish my education. Had it not been for this institution, I would not be here today."</p>
                    <p style="font-size: 12px; text-align: right;">–Nick Charles, Maryland State Delegate, District 25</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;">UDC's Green Roof</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 14px;">UDC's Green Roof is the largest food producing system of its kind, in the District of Columbia. Our 20,000 square foot green roof is the food production site for the Van Ness Urban Food Hub. The roof showcases four types of production and is also used to conduct research on plant varieties that thrive in root environments.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 70%;">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
                <div style="width: 48%;">
                    <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px;">
                        <h3 style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;">Recognizing Achievement</h3>
                        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; margin-top: 20px;">
                            <div style="text-align: center;">
                                <div style="font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; color: #a03030;">#8</div>
                                <p style="font-size: 12px;">Clinical Law Program in the Nation</p>
                                <p style="font-size: 10px;">Top 100 Law Schools</p>
                            </div>
                            <div style="text-align: center;">
                                <div style="font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; color: #a03030;">#1</div>
                                <p style="font-size: 12px;">in D.C. According to Ranking of Tuition, Financial Aid and Student Success Metrics</p>
                                <p style="font-size: 10px;">Schools.com (2017)</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
                            <div style="text-align: center;">
                                <div style="font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; color: #a03030;">#99</div>
                                <p style="font-size: 12px;">Ranked Best Community College in the Nation</p>
                                <p style="font-size: 10px;">WalletHub</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div style="width: 48%;">
                    <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px;">
                        <h3 style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;">51%</h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 12px;">Increase in First Time College Students</p>
                    </div>
                    <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; margin-top: 20px;">
                        <h3 style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;">2018 Sustainability Award Winner</h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 12px;">University of the District of Columbia</p>
                        <p style="font-size: 12px;">Environmental and Energy</p>
                    </div>
                    <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; margin-top: 20px;">
                        <h3 style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;">#10</h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 12px;">in HBCU in the Nation</p>
                        <p style="font-size: 12px;">(2018)</p>
                    </div>
                    <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; margin-top: 20px;">
                        <h3 style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;">UDC's Capital Builders Center is an innovative intersection of talent, scholarship, and opportunity that serves as a model for the nation.</h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 12px;">The Center is a public-private partnership that provides a pathway to entrepreneurship and business ownership.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
        <div style="width: 30%;">
            <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;">Strengthening Communities</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 14px;">Since 1988, the School of Business and Public Administration (SBPA) has partnered with the D.C. Department of Human Services, Economic Development, and other agencies to provide job skills training to individuals who receive Temporary Assistance for Needy Families (TANF) benefits in D.C.</p>
                <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                    <p style="font-size: 14px;">During the Spring 2018 tax season, the UDC Law School Tax Clinic processed more than 650 individual tax returns for D.C. residents for a total of $338,520 in tax refunds.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;">Environmental Quality Testing Laboratory (EQTL)</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 14px;">The College of Agriculture, Urban Sustainability and Environmental Sciences (CAUSES) achieved accreditation for its Environmental Quality Testing Laboratory (EQTL) through the National Laboratory Accreditation Program (NELAP) Accreditation Council. The EQTL of UDC offers full-service environmental sampling and analysis services to the D.C. metropolitan area and beyond.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 70%;">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
                <div style="width: 48%;">
                    <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px;">
                        <h3 style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;">National Green Infrastructure Certification Program (NGICP)</h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 14px;">CAUSES partnered with D.C. Water and the NGICP to help D.C. residents learn about green infrastructure. More than 70 D.C. residents have been trained in green infrastructure practices, which helps to improve the quality of life and the environment in D.C.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; margin-top: 20px;">
                        <h3 style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;">Building Bridges Across the River</h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 14px;">For the last two years, the 11th Street Bridge Project, a project of the Ward 8-based nonprofit organization, has been working with DC Housing Authority and UDC to create urban green spaces in the city.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div style="width: 48%;">
                    <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px;">
                        <h3 style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;">Conferences and Symposiums</h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 14px;">Annual Conference of the Academy of International-South East Region: The University of the District of Columbia – School of Business and Public Administration proudly hosted the Annual Conference of the Academy of International-South East Region in October 2017 on the UDC campus. More than 240 participants attended the conference.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; margin-top: 20px;">
                        <h3 style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;">2018 Mid-Atlantic Regional Conference:</h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 14px;">The College of Agriculture, Urban Sustainability and Environmental Sciences (CAUSES) partnered with the Mid-Atlantic Regional Conference (MARC) to host the 2018 Mid-Atlantic Regional Conference. The conference brought together researchers and practitioners from across the region to discuss critical issues in urban sustainability.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
